<rml><head><title>Battery and power</title><style>
body { margin:0; width:100%; height:100%; font-family:DejaVu Sans; color:#dfe8f6; font-size:13dp; }
div { display:block; box-sizing:border-box; }
#panel { position:absolute; left:12dp; right:12dp; top:12dp; bottom:12dp; padding:24dp; background:#171f2cfb; border:1dp #3b495e; border-radius:22dp; box-shadow:#0007 0dp 5dp 12dp 2dp; animation:0.24s cubic-out 1 open; }
#heading { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; color:#8fa1ba; font-size:11dp; letter-spacing:1.5dp; }
button { display:block; padding:4dp 10dp; font-size:19dp; border-radius:9dp; color:#b8c9df; background:#293549; transition:background-color 0.16s; }
button:hover { background:#40536b; }
#summary { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18dp; margin-top:22dp; }
#big-battery { width:83dp; height:42dp; padding:5dp; position:relative; border:2dp #69a98f; border-radius:9dp; }
#tip { position:absolute; right:-7dp; top:12dp; width:4dp; height:16dp; background:#69a98f; border-radius:2dp; }
#fill { width:70%; height:100%; background:#99e8c4; border-radius:3dp; }
#percent { font-size:38dp; font-weight:bold; color:#b6f6d6; }
#state { margin-top:18dp; font-size:17dp; font-weight:bold; }
#estimate { margin-top:8dp; font-size:12dp; color:#8fa6bd; }
#details { margin-top:22dp; padding-top:16dp; border-top:1dp #334359; }
.row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:12dp; color:#93a5bf; font-size:12dp; }
.value { color:#d4e3f4; }
#note { margin-top:16dp; color:#8296b0; font-size:11dp; }
#panel.low #fill { background:#eec879; } #panel.low #percent { color:#eec879; }
#panel.critical #fill { background:#f38595; } #panel.critical #percent { color:#f38595; }
@keyframes open { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(12dp); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0dp); } }
</style></head><body><div id="panel">
<div id="heading"><div>BATTERY &amp; POWER</div><button id="close">×</button></div>
<div id="summary"><div id="big-battery"><div id="fill"/><div id="tip"/></div><div id="percent">100%</div></div>
<div id="state">Fully charged</div><div id="estimate">Ready when you are</div>
<div id="details"><div class="row"><div>Battery health</div><div id="health" class="value">Unavailable</div></div>
<div class="row"><div>Charge cycles</div><div id="cycles" class="value">Unavailable</div></div>
<div class="row"><div>Power source</div><div id="source" class="value">AC adapter</div></div></div>
<div id="note">Estimates adapt to your current power usage.</div>
</div></body></rml>
